{"entities":[{"allDefines":["Kripke.frameOfPreorder"],"anchor":"Kripke-frameOfPreorder","html":"<div class=\"lean-item\" id=\"Kripke-frameOfPreorder\"><pre class=\"hl lean\"><code><span class=\"keyword\">abbrev</span> <a href=\"/lean/kripke/Kripke.Examples.html#Kripke-frameOfPreorder\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">frameOfPreorder</span></a> (<span class=\"var\">W</span> : <span class=\"sort\">Type</span> <span class=\"level-var\">u</span>) [<a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Preorder\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">Preorder</span></a> <span class=\"var\">W</span>]\n    (<span class=\"var\">v</span>    : <span class=\"var\">W</span> → ℕ → <span class=\"sort\">Prop</span>)\n    (<span class=\"var\">mono</span> : ∀ {<span class=\"var\">w</span> <span class=\"var\">w'</span> : <span class=\"var\">W</span>} {<span class=\"var\">i</span> : ℕ}, <span class=\"var\">w</span> ≤ <span class=\"var\">w'</span> → <span class=\"var\">v</span> <span class=\"var\">w</span> <span class=\"var\">i</span> → <span class=\"var\">v</span> <span class=\"var\">w'</span> <span class=\"var\">i</span>) : <a href=\"/lean/kripke/Kripke.Frame.html#Kripke-Frame-val\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">Frame</span></a> <span class=\"var\">W</span> <span class=\"keyword\">where</span>\n  <a href=\"/lean/kripke/Kripke.Frame.html#Kripke-Frame-val\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">val</span></a>    := <span class=\"var\">v</span>\n  <a href=\"/lean/kripke/Kripke.Frame.html#Kripke-Frame-val\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">le_val</span></a> := <span class=\"var\">mono</span></code></pre></div>\n","htmlFile":"Kripke.Examples.html","htmlGroup":"<div class=\"lean-item\" id=\"Kripke-frameOfPreorder\"><pre class=\"hl lean\"><code><span class=\"keyword\">abbrev</span> <a href=\"/lean/kripke/Kripke.Examples.html#Kripke-frameOfPreorder\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">frameOfPreorder</span></a> (<span class=\"var\">W</span> : <span class=\"sort\">Type</span> <span class=\"level-var\">u</span>) [<a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Preorder\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">Preorder</span></a> <span class=\"var\">W</span>]\n    (<span class=\"var\">v</span>    : <span class=\"var\">W</span> → ℕ → <span class=\"sort\">Prop</span>)\n    (<span class=\"var\">mono</span> : ∀ {<span class=\"var\">w</span> <span class=\"var\">w'</span> : <span class=\"var\">W</span>} {<span class=\"var\">i</span> : ℕ}, <span class=\"var\">w</span> ≤ <span class=\"var\">w'</span> → <span class=\"var\">v</span> <span class=\"var\">w</span> <span class=\"var\">i</span> → <span class=\"var\">v</span> <span class=\"var\">w'</span> <span class=\"var\">i</span>) : <a href=\"/lean/kripke/Kripke.Frame.html#Kripke-Frame-val\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">Frame</span></a> <span class=\"var\">W</span> <span class=\"keyword\">where</span>\n  <a href=\"/lean/kripke/Kripke.Frame.html#Kripke-Frame-val\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">val</span></a>    := <span class=\"var\">v</span>\n  <a href=\"/lean/kripke/Kripke.Frame.html#Kripke-Frame-val\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">le_val</span></a> := <span class=\"var\">mono</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"lean-item\"><pre class=\"hl lean\"><code>/-!\n## Example: Topological Kripke Frame\n\nFor any topological space `X` and family of opens `p : ℕ → Opens X`, the\ndual of the opens lattice `(Opens X)ᵒᵈ` — ordered by **reverse** inclusion\n(`U ≤ V` iff `V ⊆ U`, i.e. `V` is a restriction of `U`) — is a\n`Kripke.Frame` via `frameOfPreorder`.\n\nThe valuation `val U i = (U ⊆ p i)` says &quot;variable `i` holds on `U`&quot; means\nthe entire open set `U` lies inside the extent `p i` of variable `i`.\nMonotonicity holds: if `V ⊆ U ⊆ p i` then `V ⊆ p i`.\n-/</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"lean-item\"><pre class=\"hl lean\"><code><span class=\"keyword\">open</span> TopologicalSpace</code></pre></div>\n","name":"Kripke.frameOfPreorder","simpleName":"frameOfPreorder"},{"allDefines":["Kripke.opensFrame"],"anchor":"Kripke-opensFrame","html":"<div class=\"lean-item\" id=\"Kripke-opensFrame\"><pre class=\"hl lean\"><code><span class=\"doc-comment\">/-- Kripke frame on `(Opens X)ᵒᵈ` (reverse-inclusion order).\n    Variable `i` holds on `U` iff `U ⊆ p i`. -/</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">abbrev</span> <a href=\"/lean/kripke/Kripke.Examples.html#Kripke-opensFrame\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">opensFrame</span></a> (<span class=\"var\">X</span> : <span class=\"sort\">Type</span> <span class=\"level-var\">u</span>) [<a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=TopologicalSpace\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">TopologicalSpace</span></a> <span class=\"var\">X</span>]\n    (<span class=\"var\">p</span> : ℕ → <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=TopologicalSpace.Opens\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">Opens</span></a> <span class=\"var\">X</span>) : <a href=\"/lean/kripke/Kripke.Frame.html#Kripke-Frame-val\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">Frame</span></a> (<a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=TopologicalSpace.Opens\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">Opens</span></a> <span class=\"var\">X</span>)ᵒᵈ :=\n  <a href=\"/lean/kripke/Kripke.Examples.html#Kripke-frameOfPreorder\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">frameOfPreorder</span></a> _\n    (<span class=\"keyword\">fun</span> <span class=\"var\">U</span> <span class=\"var\">i</span> =&gt; <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=OrderDual.ofDual\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">OrderDual.ofDual</span></a> <span class=\"var\">U</span> ≤ <span class=\"var\">p</span> <span class=\"var\">i</span>)\n    (<span class=\"keyword\">fun</span> <span class=\"var\">h</span> <span class=\"var\">hv</span> =&gt; (<a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=OrderDual.ofDual_le_ofDual\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">OrderDual.ofDual_le_ofDual</span></a>.<a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Iff.mpr\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">mpr</span></a> <span class=\"var\">h</span>).<a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=LE.le.trans\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">trans</span></a> <span class=\"var\">hv</span>)</code></pre></div>\n","htmlFile":"Kripke.Examples.html","htmlGroup":"<div class=\"lean-item\" id=\"Kripke-opensFrame\"><pre class=\"hl lean\"><code><span class=\"doc-comment\">/-- Kripke frame on `(Opens X)ᵒᵈ` (reverse-inclusion order).\n    Variable `i` holds on `U` iff `U ⊆ p i`. -/</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">abbrev</span> <a href=\"/lean/kripke/Kripke.Examples.html#Kripke-opensFrame\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">opensFrame</span></a> (<span class=\"var\">X</span> : <span class=\"sort\">Type</span> <span class=\"level-var\">u</span>) [<a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=TopologicalSpace\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">TopologicalSpace</span></a> <span class=\"var\">X</span>]\n    (<span class=\"var\">p</span> : ℕ → <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=TopologicalSpace.Opens\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">Opens</span></a> <span class=\"var\">X</span>) : <a href=\"/lean/kripke/Kripke.Frame.html#Kripke-Frame-val\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">Frame</span></a> (<a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=TopologicalSpace.Opens\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">Opens</span></a> <span class=\"var\">X</span>)ᵒᵈ :=\n  <a href=\"/lean/kripke/Kripke.Examples.html#Kripke-frameOfPreorder\" class=\"lean-link\"><span class=\"const\">frameOfPreorder</span></